text: Knight Flight: Dragon Down! is a physics puzzle where you launch knights from a catapult, bounce them off a drifting trampoline cloud, and use a timed Shield Drop to smash the dragon's wobbly tower. Aim with Up/Down (or W/S), hold and release Space to launch, press Space in mid-air to Shield Drop, and press Enter to start or retry — knock the dragon to the ground within 5 knights to win the treasure.
